- Citizen complaint submission
- Optional image upload
- Local AI-style text classification using TF-IDF + Logistic Regression
- Automatic category and department routing
- Priority prediction
- Confidence score
- SQLite database
- Shared department dashboard
- Complaint detail page
- Department status/resolution updates
- Citizen complaint tracking
- Responsive HTML/CSS UI

